  "description": "Low-code edition of GroupDocs.Merger for .NET. Exposes a small set of single-operation products — JoinDocx, JoinPdf, JoinPptx, RemovePagesPdf, SplitDocx, SplitPdf and SplitPptx — that each perform one document operation through a construct-and-Save call, with the rest of the library kept internal.\n\nFor more details on the GroupDocs.Merger for .NET API, please visit the product website at:\nhttps://products.groupdocs.com/merger/net\n\nNote: The library will run in evaluation mode. In order to test full features of the product, please request a free 30-day temporary license.",
